{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "86b2eba8-396f-5abb-a558-6da486f552f9", "source_ordinal": 43, "reading_ordinal": 4016, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "饱汉饥", "published_at": "2026-07-07T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://www.ifdian.net/p/9ea8178a73f111f1a72c52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "index": 1, "text": "小时候有一块钱买零食就可以很快乐，考试拿到一个好的名次就可以很开心，发现我爱的人也爱着我会感到很幸福，随着年龄的成长，有房有车年入百万只能获得一点满足感，能让我们感到幸福和快乐的事情越来越少了，你是怎么样让自己重新可以轻易获得幸福和快乐的呢？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 121}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "从得到、占有中获得的快乐，一旦超过了生活所需，就会迅速的趋向于饱和和麻木。", "char_start": 122, "char_end": 159}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "饿着肚子的时候一个老馒头都让你感到幸福，一旦吃饱了吃撑了，就是海参鲍鱼堆起来你也没有兴趣。", "char_start": 160, "char_end": 205}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "因为自然法不鼓励人在生存需求之外无限制的浪费资源，凡是没有这条情绪反射的物种都会在食物丰富的时候撑死，而在食物匮乏的时候因为单个强壮个体占有食物过多而导致种群崩溃。", "char_start": 206, "char_end": 288}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "只要你顺着自然法的思路看过去，就知道自然法对吃饱了的个体的要求。", "char_start": 289, "char_end": 321}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "它很自然的要求有能力为自己获得超过生活必需的食物和资源的个体转向分享、保护和领导其他成员。", "char_start": 322, "char_end": 367}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你吃饱了，更大的快乐就会是看到同伴们吃掉没吃完的肉、满足的打呼噜。", "char_start": 368, "char_end": 401}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "吃饱的快乐有尽头，但看着同伴们越来越多、越来越茁壮的快乐没有尽头。", "char_start": 402, "char_end": 435}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "一旦你吃饱喝足，奖励的规则就变成了分享越多越快乐，而不是占有越多越快乐。", "char_start": 436, "char_end": 472}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "分享得过多，导致自己的剩余低于了自己的生活必需，分享的快乐就失效；占有得太多，导致自己的剩余高于了自己的生活所需，占有的快乐就失效。", "char_start": 473, "char_end": 539}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "自然法就卡在这条“生活的必需线”上，看着一些人在这个分界线上折腾。", "char_start": 540, "char_end": 573}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "一些人对占有的快乐极为执着，发现超过了必需线，规则开始变了，ta不是去顺应规则变化，而是悄悄的挪动“必需线”，继续生活在一个人造的不满足的状态，继续追求占有更多物质的快感。", "char_start": 574, "char_end": 660}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这个做法是可以达到这个目的，但是带来的副作用是原本可以让自己很满足的那份收入，现在根本不够塞牙缝的。", "char_start": 661, "char_end": 711}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "ta为了保住“不能吃龙虾都没感觉”的目标，失去了“吃老面馒头就能很开心”的能力，一旦要是发生了什么变故，导致ta吃不起龙虾了，那就要陷入明明老面馒头可以活命却永远觉得饥饿难当的困境。", "char_start": 712, "char_end": 803}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "再要快乐就难了。", "char_start": 804, "char_end": 812}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "看清楚这根线，过了这根线，游戏规则就变了。", "char_start": 813, "char_end": 834}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "别作弊，作弊将来是有代价的。", "char_start": 835, "char_end": 849}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"quote": 1, "paragraph": 17}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0572"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：成年人感到幸福和快乐的阈值越来越高怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017"], "summary": "围绕“饱汉饥”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“小时候有一块钱买零食就可以很快乐，考试拿到一个好的名次就可以很开心，发现我爱的人也爱着我会感到很幸福，随着年龄的成长，有房有车年入百万只能获得一点满足感，能让我们感到幸福和快乐的事情越来越少了，你是怎么样让自己重新可以轻易获得幸福和快乐的呢？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "小时候有一块钱买零食就可以很快乐，考试拿到一个好的名次就可以很开心，发现我爱的人也爱着我会感到很幸福，随着年龄的成长，有房有车年入百万只能获得一点满足感，能让我们感到幸福和快乐的事情越来越少了，你是怎么样让自己重新可以轻易获得幸福和快乐的呢？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 121, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4605e04c-70c0-5b06-bfff-54b358fa6cc4", "source_ordinal": 38, "reading_ordinal": 4017, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "防事墙", "published_at": "2026-07-07T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/665271216/answer/2038271388750967161"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "有一句接近废话的法则来解决这个问题：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "当你有内心想做的事情的时候，你可以不必逼迫自己做内心不想做的事情。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 52}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这是不是一句废话？", "char_start": 53, "char_end": 62}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "然而这句废话是不是把你噎住了？", "char_start": 63, "char_end": 78}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "因为你发现你没有内心想做的事情。", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 95}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "不是说没有欲望——你想当明星、想成为知名的科学家、想当大官、想当富豪……", "char_start": 96, "char_end": 132}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "欲望都是有的，但是那都是结果，不是“要做的事情”。一说要做的事情，说到这个“做”字，你就卡死了。", "char_start": 133, "char_end": 181}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你只想直接享受结果，你不想做从开头到结果之间的那些事。", "char_start": 182, "char_end": 209}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你可能要问，那打游戏可以算我想做的事吗？", "char_start": 210, "char_end": 230}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "除非你要打职业，否则不算。因为做事和娱乐时间有区别——做事产生有交换价值、使用价值的成果。", "char_start": 231, "char_end": 276}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "不产生这种成果，这就不叫“做事”。", "char_start": 277, "char_end": 294}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "所以最后这句废话就正敲在你头上了——你没有内心想做的事。", "char_start": 295, "char_end": 323}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "既然你没有内心想做的事，那就敬酒不吃只好吃罚酒——你就只剩下“强求自己去做内心不想做的事”这一条路了。", "char_start": 324, "char_end": 375}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "趁着年轻，一定要珍惜做事的机会呀。早点学会在某种产生成果的劳动中享受到乐趣。", "char_start": 376, "char_end": 414}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "比如你熟练掌握包饺子，练到如行云流水，吃到的人都鲜掉眉毛的程度，自己干起来赏心悦目，心情舒畅。", "char_start": 415, "char_end": 462}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "那么在“逼迫自己做内心不想做的事”的战壕前面就多了一道防火墙。", "char_start": 463, "char_end": 494}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你要有十七八件喜欢做的产生价值的事，你就自然而然不会沦落到“必须强迫自己做内心不想做的事”的地步。", "char_start": 495, "char_end": 544}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "就这么简单。", "char_start": 545, "char_end": 551}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "早点动手，救救自己。", "char_start": 552, "char_end": 562}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 19}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0572"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：内心不想做的事要强迫自己去做吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019"], "summary": "围绕“防事墙”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“有一句接近废话的法则来解决这个问题：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "有一句接近废话的法则来解决这个问题：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4acdd38f-59cb-51e5-a4af-56dc3112c805", "source_ordinal": 39, "reading_ordinal": 4018, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "弟子服其劳", "published_at": "2026-07-07T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1949963205116945961/answer/2039071433071007069"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这是个不太好的领导思路。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "提一个更好的做法。", "char_start": 13, "char_end": 22}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "提出“班上有这个搬水的需求，需要处理如此这般的一些相关职责，哪些同学有为大家服务的热情，可以稍后告诉我一下，我们看情况决定具体怎么分担职责”。", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 94}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不必提这会给什么回报，静静等待。", "char_start": 95, "char_end": 111}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "heading", "index": 5, "text": "如果没有人报名，那就自己亲自干起来，慢慢等人响应，不必等待学生们主动。", "char_start": 112, "char_end": 147}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "但是要害在于这里——在没有许诺任何回报的前提下，谁先勇于承担，那么以后就将其视为重点关注对象，给予优先待遇。", "char_start": 148, "char_end": 202}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "优先提拔为学生干部、优先入队、优先入团，优先授予“三好学生”这些荣誉……这是显然的，也是该当的——集体需要出力时愿意挺身而出，还有什么比这更配得集体的荣誉？", "char_start": 203, "char_end": 281}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "其次作业仔细批改；考试重点讲评；有不懂的地方重点讲解；有竞赛机会，只要ta够格，就优先推荐；有教师评语的机会，都给予能给予的较好评语；遇到有人欺负ta，给予坚决有效的庇护。", "char_start": 282, "char_end": 368}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "说得江湖一点，我开口发任务，你在没有承诺回报的前提下勇于回应，我只要办得到，当然不能让你吃亏。", "char_start": 369, "char_end": 416}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "但是要注意，优先归优先、倾斜归倾斜，但那是多给机会、排在前面，而不是无视标准、不分是非，绝不能偏袒到让别的学生觉得“单凭本事不可能赢得了ta”“就算有理对上ta也会败诉”的程度。", "char_start": 417, "char_end": 506}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "也不要随便拿ta做榜样去批评其他学生“不合格”“不优秀”。", "char_start": 507, "char_end": 536}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "如果到了这个程度，首先你给这个孩子带来的就不是其他同学的钦佩和向往，而是妒忌和怨恨；其次你会挫伤其他学生的积极性——ta们确实会意识到有这样的机会应该争取，但却有可能搞成把学习视为第二位、把钻营这类机会作为第一位，搞得本末倒置；第三这种极度偏袒会扭曲这孩子与其他人的地位关系，极易导致ta狐假虎威去霸凌别人，最后反而害了ta，甚至还要逼得你不得不亲手“挥泪斩马谡”，那就成悲剧了。", "char_start": 537, "char_end": 727}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "所以要给予优待，但要是公平、恰当的、温和的优待，绝不是不公平的偏袒。", "char_start": 728, "char_end": 762}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你的目的是要创造“如果你积极响应公共需求，我作为秩序主导者，必定不亏负你”的先例。", "char_start": 763, "char_end": 804}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "注意那个保底策略——没人响应，那就亲自出手承担，不要因为这个而批评“看来我们班上没有有担当的人”“你们一个懂事的都没有”。", "char_start": 805, "char_end": 866}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你说话没人听，那是因为你自己威望不足。你的威望不足，是因为你自己德行不足。", "char_start": 867, "char_end": 904}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "那就积攒德行，所以直接自己承担，身先士卒。", "char_start": 905, "char_end": 926}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "不要自己只动嘴，只想着要别人干，别人不干就用各种手段惩罚人的消极，逼着人干——这样你自然越带越带不动，越逼越不服。", "char_start": 927, "char_end": 984}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "养成这个习惯——发号召没人听，那就自己上，不要抱怨；有人响应，那就绝不相负。", "char_start": 985, "char_end": 1023}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "一直坚持这个朴素的做法，你以后开口要求做点什么，自然响应的人会越来越积极，越来越快。", "char_start": 1024, "char_end": 1066}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "你的威望自然建立，而且手下集体的风气自然正直。", "char_start": 1067, "char_end": 1090}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这是正道。", "char_start": 1091, "char_end": 1096}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 21, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0572"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：老师要求班上的男同学为班级搬水，你认为这合理吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022"], "summary": "围绕“弟子服其劳”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这是个不太好的领导思路。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这是个不太好的领导思路。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "561bb73f-d62d-5b2c-9af1-279bffea330d", "source_ordinal": 40, "reading_ordinal": 4019, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "阻住地球的人", "published_at": "2026-07-07T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/7793592495/answer/2057238750548201824"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "因为让ta们最痛恨的其实不是霸凌者，而是身边整个软弱、谄媚的环境。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "霸凌者有病或者有罪，这反倒是平常事，发生在你身边，虽然不幸，但在某种意义上其实是一种“天灾”。", "char_start": 34, "char_end": 81}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "真正令人愤恨的，是原本承担着守护、惩戒、遏止功能的整个社会机能的失灵。", "char_start": 82, "char_end": 117}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "父母觉得力不从心，劝ta多躲着点走。躲了，躲不过，然后父母就没别的指引了。", "char_start": 118, "char_end": 155}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "说得多了，就被要求“反省自己有什么问题”。", "char_start": 156, "char_end": 177}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "也反省了，甚至改了。没用。", "char_start": 178, "char_end": 191}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "反省再三，改正再三。真的没用。", "char_start": 192, "char_end": 207}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "问父母还能怎么改，父母也说不出了。", "char_start": 208, "char_end": 225}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "反而要发怒。", "char_start": 226, "char_end": 232}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "指望朋友，朋友在ta们父母的告诫下远离。", "char_start": 233, "char_end": 253}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "指望公愤，人人沉默，如未曾见。", "char_start": 254, "char_end": 269}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "指望老师、学校，无伤无残，查无实据。", "char_start": 270, "char_end": 288}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "指望对方的父母，对方的父母倒要警告你不要诬陷。", "char_start": 289, "char_end": 312}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "霸凌者固然可恨，但觉得霸凌者最可恨的，其实是看电影的观众。", "char_start": 313, "char_end": 342}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "当事人恨的是自己。", "char_start": 343, "char_end": 352}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "因为这整个不愿履行职责的人群之所以冷漠，其实是因为我比较劣质，不值得为我牺牲ta吧。", "char_start": 353, "char_end": 395}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "是我给世界添麻烦了。", "char_start": 396, "char_end": 406}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "是我的问题。", "char_start": 407, "char_end": 413}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "我阻住个地球转。", "char_start": 414, "char_end": 422}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "所以我要解决问题，这样大家都可以平安了。", "char_start": 423, "char_end": 443}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "那些觉得我做得不对的，是不是想说我做得不对？", "char_start": 444, "char_end": 466}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "是啊，果然还是我做得不对。", "char_start": 467, "char_end": 480}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "ta们也都是这么说的。", "char_start": 481, "char_end": 492}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你们想知道为什么。", "char_start": 493, "char_end": 502}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你们现在知道了。", "char_start": 503, "char_end": 511}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 25}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0572"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么被校园霸凌的人最后宁愿自杀，也不会去报复霸凌者？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025"], "summary": "围绕“阻住地球的人”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“因为让ta们最痛恨的其实不是霸凌者，而是身边整个软弱、谄媚的环境。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "因为让ta们最痛恨的其实不是霸凌者，而是身边整个软弱、谄媚的环境。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "6997b10c-8fe5-573f-b41f-312a70f53490", "source_ordinal": 41, "reading_ordinal": 4020, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "老实大喇叭", "published_at": "2026-07-07T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2038609413800505543/answer/2038726472618223560"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "不老实不本分，人会特别容易相信“内幕消息”“特殊关系”“捡漏机会”，对灰色操作有额外的热衷。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 46}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "正正经经的合作就兴趣缺缺，一说有门路、有内线、有特殊办法，就双目圆睁了。", "char_start": 47, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "结果一旦出了问题，对方跑路了，往往发现连报案都不好报，因为报了案对方抓不抓得到、钱追不追得回另说，自己先要背一个违法违规的处罚。", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 148}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不过ta们不往外说。", "char_start": 149, "char_end": 159}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "偷鸡不着蚀把米的事，还带违法违规情节，好对谁说？这都不是丢不丢脸的问题，别回头授人以柄，还给人送进去了。", "char_start": 160, "char_end": 212}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "老实人老实在哪？", "char_start": 213, "char_end": 221}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "不是吃亏，吃亏跟老实不老实没啥关系、纯属世事无常，人所难料。", "char_start": 222, "char_end": 252}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "ta们老实在自觉理直气壮，所以谁只要有一点不老实，事情又没有得到好的结果，老实人就特别容易把问题归结在不老实的环节。", "char_start": 253, "char_end": 311}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "ta们觉得自己完成了自己的责任，是被不老实的人连累甚至坑害了，这不是吃亏了是什么？要是大家都承担自己的责任，不逃避、不打折，事情不就办成了？", "char_start": 312, "char_end": 382}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "简直都想把那些sb揪出来打，难道吃了亏还不能说？", "char_start": 383, "char_end": 407}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "所以老实人很容易大声控诉，又叠加上一种想帮人避险的热心，所以ta们到处说。", "char_start": 408, "char_end": 445}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "其实老实人吃亏并没有特别多，没说少，但是也没有特别多。", "char_start": 446, "char_end": 473}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "老实人特别喜欢脑补自己是坏人最垂涎的目标，其实这属于自作多情——最受人瞩目的目标是走投无路而又想投机取巧、刚鼓起勇气想要翻过合法红线的人。", "char_start": 474, "char_end": 543}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "那些明知是捞偏门、还是想去缅甸发财的人。", "char_start": 544, "char_end": 564}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "老实人其实只是火气大加大喇叭罢了。", "char_start": 565, "char_end": 582}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0572"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：老实本分的人为何容易吃亏？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "围绕“老实大喇叭”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“不老实不本分，人会特别容易相信“内幕消息”“特殊关系”“捡漏机会”，对灰色操作有额外的热衷。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "不老实不本分，人会特别容易相信“内幕消息”“特殊关系”“捡漏机会”，对灰色操作有额外的热衷。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 46, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "c1f65e27-5be0-5388-aeb8-aae0f0e78b8e", "source_ordinal": 37, "reading_ordinal": 4021, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "困兽", "published_at": "2026-07-08T11:39:16.621000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2018632027277115464/answer/2049274296388817417"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "index": 1, "text": "如题，有时候儿子跟我们讲他们班级发生的事情的时候，老公也会这么回复。今天，我跟他说了我们部门一个同事，经常在办公室给他老公打电话，声音特别嗲，说话甜度很高的那种，而且大家都能听得到的一种声音。我就跟老公说，我特别不能理解为什么要在“公共场合”旁若无人地以这种口气跟老公说话，然后，老公又给了我一句这样的回复。可是我不知道该如何怼他？怎么破解？PS：这只是一个例子，还有很多其他的事情。另外，这个例子里，我不明白大家为什么觉得她做得没有错。二十多人的大办公室，大家都在安静地办公，只有她旁若无人嗲嗲得给老公打电话，一打打半天！你们觉得这么做没问题？！", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 274}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这是一个疲劳的信号。", "char_start": 275, "char_end": 285}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "他的精神太紧张、心灵已经疲惫了。", "char_start": 286, "char_end": 302}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "当你作为亲人走近他，他本能的期待着你接下来将说的、将做的会减轻他的压力。", "char_start": 303, "char_end": 339}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "希望你说的是一个好消息，让他相信他现在需要处理的问题会比他想象的更容易解决，甚至有一些已经解决、不用解决。", "char_start": 340, "char_end": 393}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "而你所说的、所做的，不但令他沮丧的感觉到“好像这是又给我提了一个新的待解决的问题”，而且更令他痛苦的，是你对“要尽力分担压力而不是增加压力”的责任毫无警醒，没有觉察。", "char_start": 394, "char_end": 477}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你甚至在这么危急的状态下，还在想着他做得“对不对”“该不该”，语气好不好。", "char_start": 478, "char_end": 515}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "而且你根本就不是对这对不对有什么疑问，而是其实已经在心里认定了他有罪，现在是要拉上网友、拉上外人来压制他可能的反抗，要惩罚他，让他为他的不讨喜、不配合而付出代价。", "char_start": 516, "char_end": 597}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "而更进一步的——他悲哀地发现，你之所以有如此过剩的安全感，是他长期打落牙齿往肚里咽、不愿意让你有任何担忧、至少有一个人能无忧无虑的尽情快乐的结果。", "char_start": 598, "char_end": 671}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "是他自己奋力争取来的。", "char_start": 672, "char_end": 683}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "他陷入了一种极端的矛盾——", "char_start": 684, "char_end": 697}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "他竭尽全力、筋疲力竭，却在制造自己不被关心、不被照顾的困境，而他不知道错在哪、不知该怎么改。", "char_start": 698, "char_end": 744}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "难道爱一个人，不正是该替她遮风挡雨、让她无忧无虑吗？而我只要露出一点疲惫、一点焦虑，岂不是会打扰她的安宁吗？", "char_start": 745, "char_end": 799}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "然而我一点疲惫、一点焦虑都不流露，你又总是觉得我其实很轻松、很闲适，并且进而会对我任何稍微不及时、稍微不热情的回应感到额外的失望和愤怒。", "char_start": 800, "char_end": 868}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "是的，看上去我明明没什么事，为什么这么不耐烦、为什么态度这么不好，这还能是因为什么？一定是因为我不爱你了，不是吗？", "char_start": 869, "char_end": 926}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "我其实不是不理解你为什么会生气，我只是不知道怎么办。", "char_start": 927, "char_end": 953}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "我不想卖惨，不仅仅是我的自尊心不允许，而是我真的不想你也担心我，不想你知道我对明年会不会被裁员没有把握，不想你知道我的腰有多疼、我的心撑得有多辛苦。", "char_start": 954, "char_end": 1028}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "我怕我把这些和盘托出，只是平添了一个夜不能寐的人。你就是被我卷入这无休止的焦虑又能如何呢？多给我做两个菜吗？小心翼翼的不惹我生气吗？如果我们两个人都陷入忧愁，孩子怎么办呢？", "char_start": 1029, "char_end": 1115}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "孩子会感到害怕的。", "char_start": 1116, "char_end": 1125}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "所以我还是只能撑住，把涌到嘴边的苦涩再次咽回去。", "char_start": 1126, "char_end": 1150}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "不解释、不寻求理解，因为要解释、要理解，就会破坏我死死守卫的安宁，变得惊恐、忧虑的你带给我的宽慰远不如会带给我的折磨大。", "char_start": 1151, "char_end": 1211}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "亲爱的，我真的想说——", "char_start": 1212, "char_end": 1223}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "我刚才态度不好，我向你道歉，我只想请求你，能不能只管和我们自己有关的事？", "char_start": 1224, "char_end": 1260}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "但我知道，其实我连这也不能说，因为这反而会吓到你。", "char_start": 1261, "char_end": 1286}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "走到这一步，他会发现自己无路可走了。", "char_start": 1287, "char_end": 1305}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "真的，无路可走。", "char_start": 1306, "char_end": 1314}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "这个希望你知道收缩事态的愿望，在他胸膛里左冲右突，每一个出口又都被他自己的重重顾虑堵死。", "char_start": 1315, "char_end": 1359}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "不停托起这冲动的是他，亲手堵住的也是他，每成功的抵挡一轮，他都会忍不住怨恨你为什么没有足够他托付的坚强。", "char_start": 1360, "char_end": 1412}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "只要循环足够多次，他的痛苦积累到一定程度，对你这份让他无法托付的不坚强就会越怨恨，直到他觉得这是可以报复的失职。", "char_start": 1413, "char_end": 1469}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "于是这句话最终突破了他的防线，变成了这个生硬的样子。", "char_start": 1470, "char_end": 1496}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "他这样做对不对？", "char_start": 1497, "char_end": 1505}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "当然“不对”。", "char_start": 1506, "char_end": 1513}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "因为按照爱的约定，他应该信任你，甚至是有义务信任你。", "char_start": 1514, "char_end": 1540}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "他应该不要把你当成弱不禁风的洋娃娃，应该相信你可以承受该有的压力，分担你可以分担的艰难。", "char_start": 1541, "char_end": 1585}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "他没这么做，其实是不对的。", "char_start": 1586, "char_end": 1599}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "然而你真的要责怪他吗？你真的期望他“改正”吗？", "char_start": 1600, "char_end": 1623}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "他对你的不信任，和基于这不信任所额外给你的保护，你真的愿意他“改正”吗？", "char_start": 1624, "char_end": 1660}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "这些话是不是在胡乱猜测，你自己去思考，估计吧。", "char_start": 1661, "char_end": 1684}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "但不建议你拿去和他验证——他瞒你瞒得这么辛苦，你去验证，他不是前功尽弃了吗？", "char_start": 1685, "char_end": 1723}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "你现在最该做的，不是问他这样做对不对——上面说过了，当然【不对】，确定无疑的【不对】。", "char_start": 1724, "char_end": 1767}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "但你要的不是他“改正”，而是要解决最终导致这痛苦的根源。", "char_start": 1768, "char_end": 1796}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "去好好泡一杯茶，去抱抱他。", "char_start": 1797, "char_end": 1810}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "什么也不必问，帮他捏捏肩膀。", "char_start": 1811, "char_end": 1825}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "他会明白的。", "char_start": 1826, "char_end": 1832}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "他会说对不起。", "char_start": 1833, "char_end": 1840}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"quote": 1, "paragraph": 45}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0572"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：跟老公讲述一件事情，他给出的回应是：关你什么事，管好你自己得了！这个时候，你该说些什么回应？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045"], "summary": "围绕“困兽”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“如题，有时候儿子跟我们讲他们班级发生的事情的时候，老公也会这么回复。今天，我跟他说了我们部门一个同事，经常在办公室给他老公打电话，声音特别嗲，说话甜度很高的那种，而且大家都能听得到的一种声音。我就跟老公说，我特别不能理解为什么要在“公共场合”旁若无人地以这种口气跟老公说话，然后，老公又给了我一句这样的回复。可是我不知道该如何怼他？怎么破解？PS：这只是一个例”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "如题，有时候儿子跟我们讲他们班级发生的事情的时候，老公也会这么回复。今天，我跟他说了我们部门一个同事，经常在办公室给他老公打电话，声音特别嗲，说话甜度很高的那种，而且大家都能听得到的一种声音。我就跟老公说，我特别不能理解为什么要在“公共场合”旁若无人地以这种口气跟老公说话，然后，老公又给了我一句这样的回复。可是我不知道该如何怼他？怎么破解？PS：这只是一个例", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 274, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b12ffdac-091e-519b-947b-a20d33f76e44", "source_ordinal": 36, "reading_ordinal": 4022, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "鲍鱼之肆", "published_at": "2026-07-08T12:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/65711987/answer/2040212448746149088"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "嗅觉和心理感受的关联是很复杂的，是可以根据人的经历在后天塑造的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "如果你小时候住过弄堂、老式木建筑、早期公用厨房区甚至卫生间的水泥宿舍楼，你应该会很熟悉那些环境的特殊气味。", "char_start": 33, "char_end": 86}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你住在里面根本不觉得，离开了也不会有太大的触动，但是一旦在异国他乡类似的环境中闻到那些气味，大量的回忆会瞬间涌上心头。", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 146}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "如果那些居住体验很愉快的话，这些气味给你的感受会是相当温暖、舒适的。然而没有和你同样感受的小孩子们却可能皱鼻掩面，难以忍受。", "char_start": 147, "char_end": 209}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "特定的气味引起喜爱还是厌恶，会被视为香、臭还是“平常”，这是人在进入这些气味后的情感体验塑造神经构造形成的后天发育成果。", "char_start": 210, "char_end": 270}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "而那些你真正受不了的气味，给你的感受其实首先不是香、臭，而是呛、辣这类超出了纯气味的刺激性感受。", "char_start": 271, "char_end": 319}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "狗可以忍受臭肉气味，更多的是因为它们本来就是食腐动物，这就像我们喜欢吃皮蛋、榴莲、臭豆腐，食用带来的愉快会让我们对相关的气味给出积极评价，我们压根就不会把皮蛋和臭豆腐的气味定义为真正的臭味。狗的食腐属性自然也会导致它们对我们人类根本不敢触碰的食物的气味有积极评价。", "char_start": 320, "char_end": 452}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "别说它们了，我们也不敢生吃蚯蚓、飞蛾，这些气味对我们也无法忍受，但对鸟类怕是清香扑鼻。", "char_start": 453, "char_end": 496}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "臭是一个主观价值评价，怕是一个主观情感反应。", "char_start": 497, "char_end": 519}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "是闻到味道后发生的事情教会你怕，是因为怕才定义了臭。", "char_start": 520, "char_end": 546}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "换言之——如果你身边有一个既勇敢又温柔、支持的积极的社会环境，你会发现，你的食性会天然的比一个消极、脆弱、悲观的环境中长大的人广阔。", "char_start": 547, "char_end": 613}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你不能闻的味道、不能吃的东西要远比后者少。", "char_start": 614, "char_end": 635}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "相对来说你比较不容易死于饥饿，但这也不全是好事——你会比ta们更容易死于食物中毒。", "char_start": 636, "char_end": 677}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 13}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0572"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么狗的嗅觉这么灵敏却不怕臭？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“鲍鱼之肆”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“嗅觉和心理感受的关联是很复杂的，是可以根据人的经历在后天塑造的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "嗅觉和心理感受的关联是很复杂的，是可以根据人的经历在后天塑造的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "15e6750c-c146-58ea-b925-3a495204a3ef", "source_ordinal": 31, "reading_ordinal": 4023, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "三分一又三分一", "published_at": "2026-07-08T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/458676234/answer/2057597134300614774"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "“习得性无助”说到底，其实是失败太多了，不光是信心坏了，连对“我有一天可以重建信心”这一点都丧失了信心。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 52}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这有两个原因：", "char_start": 53, "char_end": 60}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "1）尝试的挑战规模过大，无法在一次性努力中达成。", "char_start": 61, "char_end": 85}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这本质上就像一个人想一次蹦跳就跳上泰山之巅。以此为目标，蹦跳了一百次，一千次——直接跳试过了，助跑跳试过了，背越式试过了，撑杆跳都试过了。", "char_start": 86, "char_end": 155}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "每一次都失败。", "char_start": 156, "char_end": 163}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "不光每一次都失败，而且尽管不断更换方法，却一点都没看到“一次比一次接近成功”的迹象。", "char_start": 164, "char_end": 206}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "反倒经常发现新尝试离山顶反而更远了，得分反倒越来越低了。", "char_start": 207, "char_end": 235}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "然后低头一看，自己的存粮日趋见底，身体一天比一天疲惫。所有的趋势都在指向一个结论——完成这个目标是不可能的。", "char_start": 236, "char_end": 290}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这时就习得了这份无助。", "char_start": 291, "char_end": 302}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这里犯的错误，就是“错误的估计了一次性努力可以消解的问题规模”——包子太大，嘴太小，一口真的吞不下去。", "char_start": 303, "char_end": 354}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "2）缺少将大问题有效的切割成小问题并依工序有效衔接的能力。", "char_start": 355, "char_end": 384}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "一个包子太大，一口吃不了，切成十二份，不就可以一口一口的吃完了吗？", "char_start": 385, "char_end": 418}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "然而这个问题远没有这么简单，远远的不止。", "char_start": 419, "char_end": 439}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "举个最典型的例子，那就是一块手表，必须要完整的组装起来才能成功正常的走时。如果你对钟表的原理一无所知，仅仅是给你一大堆零件让你直接去拼，你是很难知道要先把一二三拼成A，4567拼成B，9、10…15拼成C……最后再如何把ABCD……K拼成一个完整的手表的。", "char_start": 440, "char_end": 568}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "因为你在拼ABCD……的时候，先就必须知道ABCD为什么要这样分，为什么ABCD……IJK这样拼起来钟表就一定能走动起来。进而——也是最关键的——你凭什么知道A已经拼好了，应该开始拼B了。", "char_start": 569, "char_end": 663}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "heading", "index": 16, "text": "这份“有效的规划任务、为每一个任务确定验收标准、确保所有任务的成果的总和一定可以确保最终目标的达成”的规划能力不足，才是习得性无助最大的、最本质的根源。", "char_start": 664, "char_end": 740}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你不是完成任务的能力不足，而是规划的能力不足。", "char_start": 741, "char_end": 764}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这份规划的能力有两个经典的解决方法：一个是依赖完善而扎实的基础知识和严谨的系统研究方法来探索出这份正确规划；另一个则是继承已经有效达成了结果的前辈的经验做法，然后再依赖研究消化，把知其然推进到知其所以然。", "char_start": 765, "char_end": 867}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "然而，这件事难就难在了这里——被习得性无助深深困扰的往往正是处在身份焦虑感最重阶段的年轻人。这个阶段的年轻人大部分的知识储备和研究能力并不足以走第一条路，然而却又因为“求教必须忍耐指导和批评”会刺激到年轻人的身份焦虑，很容易因为敏感的防御心态刺激出强烈的屈辱感、卑贱感。", "char_start": 868, "char_end": 1003}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "搞成了一个“要学就要受辱，不忍辱就要被生活毒打”的局面。", "char_start": 1004, "char_end": 1032}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这从年轻人自己的角度出发，只能是先努力看能不能找到一个足够关切、能力也足够指导、也愿意努力温柔、谦卑一些的师傅，在这个基础上咬牙放低自己的心态，把“这是在欺负我、整我、侮辱我……”这些念头尽量克服。", "char_start": 1033, "char_end": 1132}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这真的很不容易，但很可能现实中只有这个选择。", "char_start": 1133, "char_end": 1155}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "能有更温柔、谦卑的引路人，你可以换，但对手上目前最不坏的这一个，要尽量忍耐，抓紧学习。", "char_start": 1156, "char_end": 1199}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "找到有本事的师傅带路，好好的跟着先从打好下手、做好助手开始，一点点小事做扎实、做好，从这些小事里先获得认可、获得报酬，获得“我最起码能做好这些”的信心。", "char_start": 1200, "char_end": 1276}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "一步一个脚印的往前迈。", "char_start": 1277, "char_end": 1288}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "别气馁——其实这个世界上大部分的工作都只是由两三步扎实的工序组成的，只不过还要两三个工作的加成才会组合成能直接面对最终用户的完整产品。", "char_start": 1289, "char_end": 1356}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "你能学好三个工序，就足以在一个行业里成为一个独立的环节。能学会三个环节，就已经足以创业了。", "char_start": 1357, "char_end": 1402}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "最难的其实就是最前面的三个工序，而这三个里面，最难的又是第一个。", "char_start": 1403, "char_end": 1435}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "就是你眼前的这一个。", "char_start": 1436, "char_end": 1446}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "而这一个里面，最难的也不是工序本身，而恰恰就是你这难以割舍的“是不是骗我、是不是欺负我、压榨我”的焦虑。", "char_start": 1447, "char_end": 1499}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "翻过自己这座山，山岭那边，会有阳光。", "char_start": 1500, "char_end": 1518}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "上吧。", "char_start": 1519, "char_end": 1522}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 31, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0572"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：习得性无助怎么自救？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032"], "summary": "围绕“三分一又三分一”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：““习得性无助”说到底，其实是失败太多了，不光是信心坏了，连对“我有一天可以重建信心”这一点都丧失了信心。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "“习得性无助”说到底，其实是失败太多了，不光是信心坏了，连对“我有一天可以重建信心”这一点都丧失了信心。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 52, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
